## 1. Romanian Legislation & Compliance Mapping
Under **OG no. 28/2008** and the latest **HG no. 1627/2024** governing the **2025–2029 Agricultural Register**, the register is divided into **16 standardized chapters**. 

Below is an assessment of the current codebase against these chapters, highlighting critical data gaps.

### Legislative Gap Analysis

| Legal Chapter | Scope / Legal Purpose | Current App Status | Legislative Gaps / Missing Fields |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Cap. I** | **Household Composition & Members**<br>*(Componența gospodăriei fără personalitate juridică)* | **Partially Implemented**<br>(`PersoanaFizica`, `PersoanaJuridica`, `RelatieRudenie`) | - **Head of Household designation** (*Cap de gospodărie*). In Romanian law, members must be registered relative to the head.<br>- **Date of entry/exit** from the household (for birth, death, marriage, or change of address). |
| **Cap. II** | **Land Ownership & Plot Registry**<br>*(Terenuri în proprietate & Identificarea pe parcele)* | **Partially Implemented**<br>(`Teren`, `Parcela`, dynamic land use categories) | - **Cadastral Number** (*Număr cadastral*) and **Land Registry Number** (*Carte Funciară - CF*). Critical for CAD/GIS sync.<br>- **Intravilan / Extravilan flag** for each parcel (crucial for local land taxes).<br>- **Titular drept folosință** (Holder of use right/ownership title) per parcel (mandatory in the 2025–2029 norms).<br>- **Physical Block Code** (*Cod bloc fizic / Parcelă fizică*) for APIA declarations. |
| **Cap. III** | **Agricultural Land Use Summary**<br>*(Modul de utilizare a suprafețelor agricole)* | **Partially Implemented**<br>(Accumulated lands) | - Automating calculations to group total land area by use category (arable, pasture, orchard, vineyard, forest) across the local jurisdiction. |
| **Cap. IV** | **Sown Arable Land**<br>*(Suprafața arabilă cultivată)* | **Partially Implemented**<br>(`CulturaParcela`) | - **Standard Crop Codes** (*Nomenclator coduri cultură*) aligned with MADR/APIA standard lists (currently free-text). |
| **Cap. V** | **Fruit Trees & Pomiculture**<br>*(Pomicultură - pomi răzleți & plantații)* | **Missing** | - Counting individual isolated trees (by species: apple, pear, plum, walnut) and structured orchards. |
| **Cap. VI** | **Irrigated Land**<br>*(Suprafețe efectiv irigate)* | **Partially Implemented**<br>(`SursaApa` linked to `Parcela`) | - The law requires logging the **actual surface area irrigated** (ha) per crop type per agricultural year, not just listing water sources. |
| **Cap. VII** | **Livestock Registry**<br>*(Animale domestice / sălbatice în captivitate)* | **Implemented**<br>(`AnimalIndividual`, `EvenimentAnimal`, `EfectivGrup`, unique `crotal_registry`) | - Aligns well with SNIIA (ANSVSA) rules. Only needs minor refactoring (e.g., standardizing species lists). |
| **Cap. VIII** | **Crops / Census Sampling**<br>*(Date eșantion statistic)* | **Missing** | - Special statistical metadata required for the National Institute of Statistics (INS). |
| **Cap. IX** | **Machinery & Equipment**<br>*(Utilaje, instalații agricole & silvice)* | **Partially Implemented**<br>(`Machinery` linked to `Gospodarie`) | - **Ownership Status** (owned vs. leased/rented).<br>- Grouping tractors by power classes (HP) as required by INS guidelines. |
| **Cap. X** | **Fertilizers & Pesticides**<br>*(Aplicarea îngrășămintelor & pesticidelor)* | **Missing** | - Evidența tratamentelor chimice: logging quantity of chemical vs. organic fertilizers and pesticide types applied per parcel (required for environmental compliance). |
| **Cap. XI** | **Buildings & Outbuildings**<br>*(Clădiri și construcții-anexe)* | **Partially Implemented**<br>(`Cladire`) | - **Exterior Wall Materials** (cărămidă, lemn, beton, chirpici) & **Roof Materials** (țiglă, tablă) for tax bracket determination.<br>- **Utility Connections** (electricity, water, gas, sewerage, heating) - mandatory in Chapter XI. |
| **Cap. XII** | **Crop Production Volumes**<br>*(Producția vegetală obținută)* | **Partially Implemented**<br>(`CulturaParcela` production columns) | - Separate tracking of production from greenhouses/solariums (*sere și solarii*) versus open field. |
| **Cap. XIII** | **Succession Inquiries**<br>*(Mențiuni privind succesiunile)* | **Missing** | - Tracking notifications sent to Public Notaries (SPN/BIN) regarding deceased residents and their registered assets. |
| **Cap. XIV** | **Preemption Rights**<br>*(Dreptul de preempțiune)* | **Missing** | - Registry of land sales offers, public notices, preemptor registration, and MADR/DAJ approvals (Law 17/2014). |
| **Cap. XV** | **Leases & Concessions**<br>*(Arendă și Concesiune)* | **Implemented**<br>(`ContractUtilizare` with scheduler) | - Fully implemented. Only needs migration of relationships to `Parcela` instead of `Teren` (as a contract applies to specific plots). |
| **Cap. XVI** | **Special Mentions & Leases**<br>*(Mențiuni speciale, comodat, închiriere)* | **Implemented**<br>(Via `ContractUtilizare` type `COMODAT`/`INCHIRIERE`/`ALTELE`) | - Fully implemented. |

