## 5. Prioritized Implementation Roadmap

We propose a 4-phase rollout to bring the application to full compliance and production readiness.

```mermaid
gantt
    title Agricultural Registry Roadmap
    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
    section Phase 1
    Security & GDPR Foundation    :active, p1, 2026-07-01, 30d
    section Phase 2
    Missing Legislative Data Fields : p2, 2026-08-01, 45d
    section Phase 3
    External Integrations (RAN, DITL) : p3, 2026-09-15, 60d
    section Phase 4
    UI/UX & GIS Enhancements      : p4, 2026-11-15, 30d
```

### Phase 1: Security, GDPR & Auditing (High Priority)
* **Goal:** Secure sensitive citizen data and clean up existing backend debt.
* **Tasks:**
  * Implement AES-256 JPA encryption converter for CNPs and CUIs.
  * Implement an append-only `AuditLog` service for read/write tracking of registries.
  * Resolve Lombok `@Data` warnings, switch EAGER to LAZY relations, and implement dedicated Response DTOs.
  * Fix the contract-operating user audit logic (removing client-side audit control).
  * Configure Angular Route Guards to protect pages based on user roles (`ROLE_USER`, `ROLE_ADMIN`, `ROLE_SUPER_ADMIN`).

### Phase 2: Missing Legislative Data Fields & Chapters (Medium Priority)
* **Goal:** Extend the schema and UI to encompass all 16 legal chapters of the 2025-2029 register.
* **Tasks:**
  * **Cap I:** Add "Head of Household" selection and track history of household composition changes.
  * **Cap II:** Add Cadastral/CF Numbers, Intravilan/Extravilan markers, and "Titular drept folosință" to `Parcela`.
  * **Cap XI & Cap IX:** Add wall/roof materials and utility fields for `Cladire`, and lease status / power classes for `Machinery`.
  * **Cap XIII & Cap XIV:** Create models, controllers, and Angular pages for Succession tracking and Preemption Rights.
  * **Cap XV:** Migrate lease relationship from `Teren` to `Parcela` and implement date-overlap validation.

### Phase 3: External Integrations (High Legal Importance)
* **Goal:** Connect the app to national public administration systems.
* **Tasks:**
  * Build the XML exporter for APIA declarations.
  * Build a REST exporter for local tax systems (differentiating properties by zone and tax brackets).
  * Draft the integration client for the National Agricultural Registry (RAN / ANCPI) using digital signature authentication.

### Phase 4: UI/UX & GIS Enhancements
* **Goal:** Improve operator experience and geographical features.
* **Tasks:**
  * Upgrade the Leaflet Map tool to display satellite overlays, parcel search by Cadastral/CF numbers, and overlapping boundary warnings.
  * Implement a **Certificate Template Builder** to generate PDF registry extracts (*adeverințe*) directly from the household file (compliant with local stamp and signature requirements).
  * Resolve Angular bundle size warnings by lazy-loading modules/components.
